{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2022-04-07 09:00:00', 'title': 'L3HARRIS SELECTED TO LEAD ADVANCED INTERNATIONAL WEATHER SATELLITE STUDY', 'text': "MELBOURNE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE:LHX) HAS BEEN AWARDED A CONTRACT BY THE JAPAN METEOROLOGICAL AGENCY (JMA) FOR AN ADVANCED STUDY WHICH WILL SIGNIFICANTLY IMPROVE THE ACCURACY AND TIMING OF JAPAN'S WEATHER FORECASTING. L3HARRIS WILL LEAD THE GEOSTATIONARY HYPERSPECTRAL INFRARED (IR) SOUNDER STUDY FOR THE JMA'S FUTURE ENTERPRISE. THE SIX-MONTH DESIGN STUDY BEGAN LAST MONTH AND ALLOWS L3HARRIS TO EVALUATE GEOSTATIONARY SOUNDER INSTRUMENT CONCEPTS. SOUNDERS ARE ADVANCED"}